express, show"), as an activation predictor for layer 0 MLP component 3867.

The component is a lexical detector. It fires on words for a TABLE (table, Table, tables,
Tabla, 表格, 列表, 图表), a SURFACE (surface, 表面, 外表), or EXPRESSING something
(express, expression, 表现, 表达, 表示, 发表), and more weakly on document-like nouns
(statement, manifest, chart, sheet, instrument, published). Its strongest trigger is the
single character 表. It also fires a little on the word "of" right after one of the
strong words (table of, surface of, expression of). Everything else predicts 0.
