"""A tab-spacing detector, strongest on bare indentation tokens.

Tab-only tokens have a large negative response. A single tab is strongest at
a new line, weaker after a line number or text, and suppressed when another
token has already supplied tabs. Spaces or a newline bundled with the tabs
weaken the response; tab-prefixed words have a small positive response.
