Component layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3871 is silent on most text. It goes strongly
negative on the bold marker ** (the asterisks that open and close **bold** in
Markdown), most of all when the marker follows a space (" **", as in "- **Term**"),
and less when it is glued to a word ("word**"). It is moderately negative on other
formatting markers: underscores (__), heading hashes (## and ###), doc-comment
