"""A lexical detector for facilitating, promoting, and impeding processes.

Predict a large pulse on the end-of-text marker, and positive responses to
these action-word families (strongest for 'facilitate' and Chinese '促进').
Related enabling, stimulation, and inhibition words get smaller responses.
Remember the previous token for split word endings and 'allow for'/'... of'
